<title>ITALY: Olivetti end-Oct debt 3.028 trln lire.</title>
<headline>Olivetti end-Oct debt 3.028 trln lire.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian information technology group Olivetti said its net financial debt at the end of October was 3.028 trillion lire after 3.016 trillion lire at the end of September.</p>
<p>The group added in a statement that it had decided to dissolve its powerful decision-making executive committee.</p>
